          "text": "Description: On September 21, 2000, a witness returning from work around 5:00 observed with a telescope a bright object with a series of colors for approximately 2 hours. The object moved quickly with erratic movements without making any noise. The object disappeared with the dawn. No other information was gathered about this observation, which is likely that of a star.",
